      "writtenOn": "2026-08-19T14:36:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Instead of a ticket based process could we consider to automatically trigger mirroring of library versions referenced by a build dependency which are not yet available in the mirror ? This could be gated by a review label which only maintainers can set to ensure library updates are reviewed before they are mirrored.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 378,
        "startChar": 11,
